<section class="dark" id="different">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">How we work</p>
        <h2>Six commitments we'll hold to in writing.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="sub">We're not claiming to be better at AI than anyone else. That's not a defensible claim and you shouldn't buy it. We're claiming to be on your side of the table.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="diff">
      <div><h3>Vendor agnostic</h3><p>If the tool you own is the right tool, we keep it and make it work harder. We take no vendor commissions.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Implementation first</h3><p>A roadmap nobody builds is an expensive PDF. We deliver working systems, in production, with your team using them.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Existing stack first</h3><p>We optimize before we replace. Ripping out software is the last option, not the opening move.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Business first, AI second</h3><p>We start with the workflow and choose the technology after. Where AI isn't the right answer, we don't use it.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Measured, not promised</h3><p>Every implementation has a baseline, a KPI and a review date. We'd rather report a flat number than invent a good one.</p></div>
      <div><h3>We don't disappear</h3><p>Deployment is the middle of the job. Adoption, tuning and the next opportunity are the rest of it.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

